================================================================================
NO MOJANG CONTENT IS DISTRIBUTED
================================================================================

Lepus reads Bedrock add-ons but ships none of Mojang's material.

Mojang schema and reference metadata (https://github.com/Mojang/bedrock-samples,
licensed NOASSERTION under Mojang's own terms) is FETCHED AT BUILD TIME, pinned by
commit SHA and per-file SHA-256 in spec/upstream/bedrock-samples.lock.json, and used
only to generate source code. Neither that metadata nor any copy of Mojang's data
appears in a released artifact.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. Lepus is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Mojang Synergies AB or Microsoft Corporation.

